    "en": {
      "trackName": "Labyrinth - Watch & Phone",
      "description": "Guide a polished steel ball through a handcrafted wooden labyrinth using real motion controls.\n\nLabyrinth Maze Puzzle brings the classic wooden tilt maze toy to iPhone and Apple Watch with warm wood textures, curved maze paths, realistic physics, and carefully tuned challenge. Tilt your device to roll the ball through narrow passages, avoid dangerous drop holes, collect keys, unlock paths, and reach the finish.\n\nEvery movement matters. The ball accelerates, slows, rebounds, and rolls with momentum, giving each level a tactile physical feel instead of simple touch-based maze control.\n\nFeatures:\n• Classic wooden labyrinth gameplay\n• Real tilt-based motion controls\n• Polished steel ball physics\n• 5,000 iPhone levels\n• 5,000 Apple Watch levels\n• Independent level sets for iPhone and Apple Watch\n• Drop holes, keys, locks, and precision paths\n• Progressive difficulty from relaxed to expert\n• Calibration for comfortable play\n• Haptics and sound feedback\n• Clean, premium wooden toy-inspired design\n\nWhether you play for a quick challenge or work your way through thousands of levels, Labyrinth Maze Puzzle rewards patience, balance, precision, and a steady hand.",
